{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-20","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"If there be three magnitudes, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, and if ex aequali the first be greater than the third, the fourth will also be greater than the sixth; if equal, equal; and, if less, less.","book":5,"number":20,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":20,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","contentId":"euclid-5-20","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c240ba7f31c8ddf3992ddc280bd85c340c1e89b6bbef5db774c3b94ff3258a14","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-20.statement","euclid-5-20.construction.1","euclid-5-20.proof.1","euclid-5-20.proof.2","euclid-5-20.proof.3","euclid-5-20.proof.4","euclid-5-20.conclusion","euclid-5-20.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-20.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0701acc453f120444eea985451d6e66764accbee00165141e502e4d2304f3e3c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be three magnitudes, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, and if ex aequali the first be greater than the third, the fourth will also be greater than the sixth; if equal, equal; and, if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有三个等量,而其他等量,以两个和两个为单位,比例相同,如果前等等值比第三,则第四等值也大于第六等;如果等值,则相等;如果等值,则更少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"34d921893e1cd23b3955120e0d0f9304ac6c2709b5da4561182b829e246b26fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be three magnitudes A, B, C, and others D, E, F equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two are in the same ratio, so that, as A is to B, so is D to E, and as B is to C, so is E to F; and let A be greater than C ex aequali; I say that D will also be greater than F; if A is equal to C, equal; and, if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A、B、C等分之三,其他D、E、F等分之五,两者之比相同,A至B等同D,E等同E,B等同E;A等同C等同C等同C;A等同D等同F,D等同C等同A等同C,C等同A等同A等同C,如果等同A等同C,则等同B,或少等,则少；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；B 与 C 之比等于 E 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d74adbc4c301d60c1c947b09f53b324ed0a0ec145ff35264a2bc253c974f191","citations":["euclid-5-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is greater than C, and B is some other magnitude, and the greater has to the same a greater ratio than the less has, [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)] therefore A has to B a greater ratio than C has to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A大于C,B是其他一些级,数量必须比较小的数量多到较大的比,因此,A到Ba比C要多到B。 [[V. 8](/principles/euclid-5-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe514e4c383c8de68d0445dd8a88f0eb6e8cde4b1cce8e4f94b865391a1f9c21","citations":["euclid-5-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as A is to B, so is D to E, and, as C is to B, inversely, so is F to E; therefore D has also to E a greater ratio than F has to E. [[V. 13](/principles/euclid-5-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,A对B的比等于D对E的比,而C对B的比则等于F对E的比;因此,D对E的比也等于A对F比F对E的比；A 与 B 之比等于 D 与 E 之比。 [[V. 13](/principles/euclid-5-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"28810df9bcb5ae704dbd41f7b7c65b01836d1dee244f8be0fe03d72b4d018a99","citations":["euclid-5-10"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, of magnitudes which have a ratio to the same, that which has a greater ratio is greater; [[V. 10](/principles/euclid-5-10)] therefore D is greater than F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,与同样比例的量,较大的比的量更大;因此,D的量大于F。 [[V. 10](/principles/euclid-5-10)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a181573af3331fda1f3fde60c264e3e8a9f10d0f3cab5ac245e0e3d6e16de695","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that, if A be equal to C, D will also be equal to F; and if less, less."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,如果A等于C,D等于F;如果少于F,则更少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-20.source","contentId":"euclid-5-20","revisionId":"euclid-5-20@raw-c240ba7f31c8ddf3","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65337b9f504bd08e81b6b1a10cd85c4df20f0c42347e6754b989d611274680de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-20:euclid-5-8:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-20.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-8","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"V. 8"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-20:euclid-5-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-20.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"V. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-20:euclid-5-10:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-20","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-20.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-10","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.20/","sourceLabel":"V. 10"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-22:euclid-5-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-22","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-22.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.22","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.22/","sourceLabel":"V. 20"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-20:euclid-5-8:explicit","id":"euclid-5-8","book":5,"number":8,"kind":"proposition","title":"不等量对应的比例大小关系","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-20:euclid-5-13:explicit","id":"euclid-5-13","book":5,"number":13,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-20:euclid-5-10:explicit","id":"euclid-5-10","book":5,"number":10,"kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-22:euclid-5-20:explicit","id":"euclid-5-22","book":5,"number":22,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[